# Lab 15 — Layer Diagram

## Step 1 — Boxes
Layer 1: Controller
Layer 2: Service
Layer 3: Repositpry

## Step 2 — Arrow labels
Inward call: Request -> service -> repository
Outward return: response <- result <- data

## Step 3 — Correlation
Inward calls move down the layers while outward layers return up the layers

